            <span class="mk">As of {PM.long}</span>
            <p>NEFT carried <b id="ex-lg-neft">–</b> payments in {PM.month}, against <b id="ex-lg-neft0">–</b> in April 2004. Card payments at shops were <b id="ex-lg-pos">–</b>.</p>
