    <div class="break">
      <figure id="cb-cheques" style="margin:0">
        <div class="plate-head">
          <div class="t">
            <h3 id="h-cheques">Cheques peaked and have been falling since</h3>
            <div class="sub">Cheques cleared in each fiscal year, crore, 1970-71 to {lastFy}. The RBI Handbook's cheque clearance series to 2015-16, then the paper instruments line of its payment system table, drawn side by side.</div>
          </div>
