            <span class="dl"><button data-dl="svg">SVG</button><button data-dl="png">PNG</button><button data-dl="csv">CSV</button><a href="https://data.rbi.org.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a></span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="explain">
          <div class="ev">
            <span class="mk">How to read this</span>
            <p>For decades the cheque was how salaries, rents and business bills were paid. The count rose with the number of bank accounts until NEFT, cards and then UPI took its work. Cheques have not disappeared: businesses, landlords and governments still write them.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="now">
            <span class="mk">As of {lastFy}</span>
            <p><b id="ex-cq-now">–</b> cheques were cleared in {lastFy}, against a high of <b id="ex-cq-max">–</b> in <span id="ex-cq-maxy">–</span> and <b id="ex-cq-0">–</b> in 1970-71.</p>
