        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="break">
      <figure id="cb-clearing" style="margin:0">
        <div class="plate-head">
          <div class="t">
            <h3 id="h-clearing">From city clearing houses to one national grid</h3>
            <div class="sub">Left: cheque clearing houses in India, end-March, {chFirst} to {chLast}. Right: cheques cleared at the three largest centres, crore, and at the single national grid from 2024-25.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="plate-val"><div class="v acc" id="pv-clearing">–</div><div class="c">clearing houses, March {chLast}</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="frame">
          <div class="plotzone"><div id="plot-clearing" class="sm-grid two" role="img" aria-label="Clearing houses by year and cheques by clearing centre"></div></div>
          <div class="plotfoot">
            <span class="src">Source: RBI, Statistical Tables Relating to Banks in India: Table 27, number of clearing houses (DBIE report 936), and Table 22, cheque clearances by centre (DBIE report 678).</span>
