          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="explain">
          <div class="ev">
            <span class="mk">How to read this</span>
            <p>A clearing house was once a room where banks of a town exchanged the cheques drawn on each other. The Cheque Truncation System replaced the paper with images, so cheques no longer travel. Centres were folded into three grids, at Mumbai, New Delhi and Chennai, and then into one national grid. That is why the city lines stop: the cheques did not vanish, they moved to the grid.</p>
